	(text "FORGOTTEN ON FINAL SCHEMATIC\nNo 1k resistors needed to link the VREF nets to 3.3VA\nSeries resistors between 3.3VA and VREF nets would ruin ADC accuracy,\nwould cause the VREF voltage to sag each time the ADC draws current "
